<mxCell id="stage-flow-stage-10" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;10: Architecture control&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lead: Architect (fresh independent reviewer); PM coordinates (agent-roles.md)&lt;br&gt;Responsibility: independent&lt;br&gt;I: architecture-nfr-decision-register.xlsx; architecture-nfr-owner-review.md; architecture.md; architecture/sections/*.md; architecture.drawio; architecture/adr/NNN-*.md; architecture-nfr-manifest.json&lt;br&gt;U: migration_status.yaml; feature-dependencies.json&lt;br&gt;O: stage-10-pass-NNN.md&lt;br&gt;Phase B: None" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fontSize=15;fillColor=#f5f7fa;strokeColor=#2199b5;dashed=0;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2740" width="1120" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
